  title: Chandragupta I
  text: Chandragupta the First, who ruled from about 319 to 335 CE, raised the Gupta dynasty to power, helped by his marriage to the Lichchhavi princess Kumaradevi. The Gupta era is counted from 319 to 320 CE.
